sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Renderer
  participant IPC as Shell IPC
  participant W as Worker

  UI->>IPC: POST /rpc<br/>Bearer + cid + method + params
  IPC->>IPC: verify bearer (constant-time)
  IPC->>W: forward envelope
  W->>W: validate JSON Schema
  W->>W: dedupe by cid (60s LRU)
  alt success
    W-->>IPC: {cid, ok:true, result}
    IPC-->>UI: 200 result
  else validation or logic error
    W-->>IPC: {cid, ok:false, error:{code,message,hint,retryable}}
    IPC-->>UI: 200 error envelope (E_*)
  else timeout > 5s
    IPC-->>UI: E_SHELL_IPC_TIMEOUT retryable=true
  else backpressure
    IPC-->>UI: E_SHELL_IPC_BACKPRESSURE 503
  end
